    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Stick Ragdoll Battle Simulator</strong>! A unique strategy game where ragdoll physics meets epic stickman battles! Build your armies, devise tactics, and watch chaotic fights unfold\u2014full of fun and unexpected twists.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418270/extras/00e0da282d4e40584bd009e448c6187d.poster.avif?t=1740734233\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418270/extras/00e0da282d4e40584bd009e448c6187d.webm?t=1740734233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418270/extras/00e0da282d4e40584bd009e448c6187d.mp4?t=1740734233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create and Upgrade Your Army</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merge your warriors</strong> to enhance their stats and turn weak fighters into true champions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock new units</strong> with unique abilities\u2014from swift swordsmen to heavily armored giants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop your own strategies</strong> by balancing long-range archers, powerful knights, and siege weapons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418270/extras/d7f9a933a59659b821e3269735e6ffcf.poster.avif?t=1740734233\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418270/extras/d7f9a933a59659b821e3269735e6ffcf.webm?t=1740734233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418270/extras/d7f9a933a59659b821e3269735e6ffcf.mp4?t=1740734233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your army, merge units, harness the power of the elements, and create the most epic battles the stickmen world has ever seen! Ready for chaos? Jump into Stick Ragdoll Battle Simulator now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418270/extras/0960925eb131aa296f02ff4fede937da.poster.avif?t=1740734233\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418270/extras/0960925eb131aa296f02ff4fede937da.webm?t=1740734233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418270/extras/0960925eb131aa296f02ff4fede937da.mp4?t=1740734233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Stick Ragdoll Battle Simulator</strong>! A unique strategy game where ragdoll physics meets epic stickman battles! Build your armies, devise tactics, and watch chaotic fights unfold\u2014full of fun and unexpected twists.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418270/extras/00e0da282d4e40584bd009e448c6187d.poster.avif?t=1740734233\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418270/extras/00e0da282d4e40584bd009e448c6187d.webm?t=1740734233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418270/extras/00e0da282d4e40584bd009e448c6187d.mp4?t=1740734233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create and Upgrade Your Army</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merge your warriors</strong> to enhance their stats and turn weak fighters into true champions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock new units</strong> with unique abilities\u2014from swift swordsmen to heavily armored giants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop your own strategies</strong> by balancing long-range archers, powerful knights, and siege weapons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418270/extras/d7f9a933a59659b821e3269735e6ffcf.poster.avif?t=1740734233\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418270/extras/d7f9a933a59659b821e3269735e6ffcf.webm?t=1740734233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418270/extras/d7f9a933a59659b821e3269735e6ffcf.mp4?t=1740734233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your army, merge units, harness the power of the elements, and create the most epic battles the stickmen world has ever seen! Ready for chaos? Jump into Stick Ragdoll Battle Simulator now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418270/extras/0960925eb131aa296f02ff4fede937da.poster.avif?t=1740734233\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418270/extras/0960925eb131aa296f02ff4fede937da.webm?t=1740734233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418270/extras/0960925eb131aa296f02ff4fede937da.mp4?t=1740734233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
